"uchun moslashuvchan chastotalar."

#: src/core/ProfileManager.cpp:30
msgid ""
"Maximum power: Performance governor for CPU, Turbo Boost enabled, GPU High, "
"fans at 80%."
msgstr ""
"Maksimal quvvat: CPU uchun Performance rejimi, Turbo Boost yoqilgan, GPU "
"High, ventilyatorlar 80%."

#: src/core/ProfileManager.cpp:32
msgid ""
"Extreme cooling: All fans (CPU, GPU, chassis) spin at 100% for rapid heat "
"dissipation."
msgstr ""
"Favqulodda sovutish: Issiqlikni tez tarqatish uchun barcha ventilyatorlar "
"(CPU, GPU, korpus) 100% aylanadi."

